#: aioqzone.api.h5.model.QzoneH5API:3 of
msgid ""
"Wraps Qzone HTTP endpoints behind typed API methods. Handles login state, automatic token "
"injection, and retry-on-login-expire logic. All methods delegate to :meth:`call` for actual HTTP"
" dispatch."
msgstr "将 Qzone HTTP 端点封装为类型化的 API 方法。处理登录状态、自动 token 注入和登录过期重试逻辑。所有方法委托给 :meth:`call` 执行实际 HTTP 分发。"

#: ../../../docstring aioqzone.api.h5.QzoneH5API.qzone_tokens:1 of
msgid "Cached qzonetokens keyed by host uin."
msgstr "以 host uin 为键缓存的 qzonetoken。"

#: aioqzone.api.h5.model.QzoneH5API.call:1 of
msgid "Execute an API call with full lifecycle management."
msgstr "执行具有完整生命周期管理的 API 调用。"

#: aioqzone.api.h5.model.QzoneH5API.call:3 of
msgid ""
"Builds params, injects authentication (g_tk, qzonetoken, cookies), dispatches HTTP request, "
"parses response, and handles retry on login expiry."
msgstr "构建参数、注入认证信息（g_tk、qzonetoken、cookies）、分发 HTTP 请求、解析响应，以及处理登录过期重试。"

